{"t":"GIS","made":"2026-11-25 03:52","name":"General Mills, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","employees":30000,"hq":"Minneapolis, MN, United States","website":"https://www.generalmills.com","summary_en":"General Mills, Inc. manufactures and markets branded consumer food in the United States and internationally. The company operates through four segments: North America Retail; International; North America Pet; and North America Foodservice. It offers snacks, including grain, fruit and savory snacks, nutrition bars, and frozen hot snacks; ready-to-eat cereal; convenient meals comprising meal kits, ethnic meals, pizza, soup, side dish mixes, frozen breakfast, and frozen entrees; wholesome natural pet food; refrigerated and frozen dough; baking mixes and ingredients; and ice cream products. The company also offers dog and cat food, such as dry food, wet food, fresh food, and treats. In addition, it operates 232 and franchises 376 ice cream parlors. The company markets its products under the Annie's, Betty Crocker, Bisquick, Blue Buffalo, Bugles, Cascadian Farm, Cheerios, Chex, Cinnamon Toast Crunch, Cocoa Puffs, Cookie Crisp, Dunkaroos, Edgard & Cooper, Fiber One, Fruit by the Foot, Fruit Gushers, Fruit Roll-Ups, Gardetto's, Gold Medal, Golden Grahams, Häagen-Dazs, Kitano, Kix, Lärabar, Latina, Lucky Charms, Nature Valley, Nudges, Oatmeal Crisp, Old El Paso, Pillsbury, Progresso, Tastefuls, Tiki Pets, Total, Totino's, Trix, True Solutions, Wanchai Ferry, Wheaties, Wilderness, and Yoki brands. It sells its products to grocery stores, mass merchandisers, membership stores, natural food chains, drug, dollar and discount chains, e-commerce retailers, commercial and noncommercial foodservice distributors and operators, restaurants, convenience stores, and pet specialty stores. The company was founded in 1866 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"General Mills, Inc.는 미국 및 해외에서 브랜드 소비자 식품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 북미 소매; 북미 소매; 국제적인; 북미 애완동물; 및 북미 식품 서비스. 곡물, 과일, 짭짤한 스낵, 영양바, 냉동 핫 스낵 등의 스낵을 제공합니다. 바로 먹을 수 있는 시리얼; 식사 키트, 민족 식사, 피자, 수프, 반찬 믹스, 냉동 아침 식사 및 냉동 주요리로 구성된 편리한 식사; 건강에 좋은 천연 애완동물 사료; 냉장 및 냉동 반죽; 베이킹 믹스 및 재료; 그리고 아이스크림 제품. 이 회사는 또한 건조 식품, 습식 식품, 신선 식품 및 간식과 같은 개 및 고양이 사료를 제공합니다. 또한 232개의 아이스크림 가게를 운영하고 376개의 프랜차이즈를 운영하고 있습니다. 회사는 Annie's, Betty Crocker, Bisquick, Blue Buffalo, Bugles, Cascadian Farm, Cheerios, Chex, Cinnamon Toast Crunch, Cocoa Puffs, Cookie Crisp, Dunkaroos, Edgard & Cooper, Fiber One, Fruit by the Foot, Fruit Gushers, Fruit Roll-Ups, Gardetto's, Gold Medal, Golden Grahams, Häagen-Dazs, Kitano, Kix, Lärabar, Latina, Lucky Charms, Nature Valley, Nudges, Oatmeal Crisp, Old El Paso, Pillsbury, Progresso, Tastefuls, Tiki Pets, Total, Totino's, Trix, True Solutions, Wanchai Ferry, Wheaties, Wilderness 및 Yoki 브랜드. 식료품점, 대량 판매점, 회원 매장, 천연 식품 체인점, 의약품, 달러 및 할인 체인점, 전자 상거래 소매점, 상업용 및 비상업적 식품 서비스 유통업체 및 운영업체, 레스토랑, 편의점, 애완동물 전문점에 제품을 판매합니다. 이 회사는 1866년에 설립되었으며 미네소타 주 미니애폴리스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":35.915,"mcap":19203289088.0,"pe":null,"fpe":11.4258175,"peg":null,"ps":1.0495551,"pb":2.5775082,"ev_ebitda":9.355,"div":6.96,"beta":-0.012,"hi52":49.59,"lo52":31.18},"fin":{"rev":18296600576.0,"rev_g":-0.028,"eps_g":-0.667,"gross":0.33728,"op":0.15624,"net":-0.04891,"roe":-0.104949996,"fcf":1302612480.0,"cash":433100000.0,"debt":13615599616.0,"de":182.422,"eps":-1.64,"feps":3.14332},"own":{"short":0.0912,"inst":0.869,"insider":0.00291},"analyst":{"n":17,"mean":36.52941,"median":35.0,"high":45.0,"low":30.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.10526,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":1,"hold":12,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":1,"hold":12,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":1,"hold":12,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":1,"hold":12,"sell":2,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Neut